sequenceDiagram
    participant A as App
    participant S as Shadow service via MQTT
    participant D as Device
    Note over A,D: Subscribe to exact response and delta topics first<br/>R = $vc/devices/device-1/shadow/name/tutorial
    A->>S: PUBLISH R/update<br/>state.desired.power=on
    S-->>A: R/update/accepted (state stored)
    S-->>D: R/update/delta<br/>state.power=on, version=N
    D->>D: Apply power setting and verify hardware
    alt Setting applied
        D->>S: PUBLISH R/update<br/>state.reported.power=on
        S-->>D: R/update/accepted
        A->>S: PUBLISH R/get
        S-->>A: R/get/accepted<br/>desired=reported, no delta
    else Hardware operation failed
        Note over D: Keep actual reported state<br/>Surface failure through application diagnostics
    end
